- swapped reconstruction member;
- revised-vintage substitution;
- future bar ancestor;
- changed strategy compiler under the same feature name;
- altered population scenario without lineage change;
- broker fingerprint replacement;
- imputation-policy change;
- parent-order nondeterminism;
- missing ancestor;
- physical copy falsely represented as a new scientific transform.

