A retained historical-scale wide-corpus build can choose arbitrary final columns and deterministically trace each back through exact upstream evidence, transformations and causal policies; regeneration reproduces the same roots when semantics are unchanged; semantic mutations alter the expected descendant roots; #681 coverage shows zero admitted features without lineage; #691 records this requirement and #525 tracks implementation/execution/evidence separately.

